{"t": 1794110997.5853088, "kind": "call", "tool": "slack_post_message", "args": {"channel_id": "C07INCID003", "text": "reports-api 502 \u2014 root cause found and fix ready. CloudWatch `/ecs/reports-api` (eu-west-1) shows: `ERROR export failed: ValueError: dict contains fields not in fieldnames: 'currency'`, alongside `INFO upstream ledger 2026.11 added currency to every row`. The CSV exporter in reports/export.py only declared id/amount, so csv.DictWriter raised on the new field and the export endpoint returned 502. Fix: added `currency` to the DictWriter fieldnames (export now emits id,amount,currency; rows without it get an empty cell). Verified locally against sample rows. Needs deploy of reports-api to clear the 502."}, "ok": true}
